  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n- Takes に particle: 〜にこだわる\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- こだわっている means 'is particular about' (ongoing state/attitude)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜にこだわる: to be particular about ~\n- こだわりの〜: ~ made with care, artisanal ~\n- こだわりがある: to have particular standards\n- こだわりが{強|つよ}い: to have strong preferences\n\nNUANCE: Originally こだわる was mainly negative (to be fixated, to fuss). In modern usage, sense 1 (positive: dedication to quality) is dominant, especially in marketing and food culture. こだわりの{一品|いっぴん} (a carefully crafted item) is a common advertising phrase.",
